{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0fd61e27a8744cfaa20223dec59566dda58bf00fb42f67b0077e979cf7748d0d", "ja": "（賑やかな声が聞こえる……。\n春香達は、もう集まっているみたいだな）", "zh": "（听到了热闹的声音……春香她们好像已经聚齐了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "696736ba2ab26ca9004c8c6fbc2f4861ce19cdba65ada29cdef1cb4add4e3ee7", "ja": "『……私の夢は、アイドルになることです。』", "zh": "『……我的梦想，是成为一名偶像。』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "4147f8ca371ddfd1776f82a52648f207bbbd3d2a9f19a97ec333f4d7af51b347", "ja": "『公園でいつもうたをうたってくれる\nお姉さんみたいに、うたって、おどって、』", "zh": "就像那位总是在公园里唱歌给我听的大姐姐一样，唱歌、跳舞，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1003_031tom", "source_sha256": "f6a4d40f5f7827471e83344fd7a666ccc4c096042e0e3760a2c6822d4eae5d69", "ja": "『テレビやざっしにも出て、大かつやくして、\nみんなでニコニコしていられるような、』", "zh": "『还要登上电视和杂志，大显身手，\n让大家都能一直笑眯眯的，』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "3e4fe37041c3d83545b0dfd833e714417083be4e0323bbbb8e612b9ceb1df8fa", "ja": "『そんなステキなアイドルに、私はなりたいです。\n天海春香』", "zh": "『我想成为那样出色的偶像。\n天海春香』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "c1ed8ebacd7e7b747f193901d2fe9e22c54b8a4494625dd2a46d329215938983", "ja": "うう、人に読まれると、よけいに恥ずかしいような……\nほらね、なんていうか普通でしょ？", "zh": "呜呜，被人念出来，感觉格外难为情呢……\n你看嘛，怎么说呢，很普通对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "60679775b925b5fc528447610f653e2a6f378608a7d2a5bbc0a1e85ae82540ea", "ja": "うふふっ、そうですか？\n春香さんらしい、素敵な夢だと思いましたよ～。", "zh": "呵呵，是这样吗？\n我觉得这是很有春香风格的美好梦想哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "e29bbf1285b8d5d3a844cf8c658b35435d7f1c66747d40a9ad1992db60bc1b5b", "ja": "姫もふわふわな気持ちになったのです。\nとってもまっすぐで、どりーみん！なのです♪", "zh": "公主的心情也变得轻飘飘的了。\n非常纯粹，超级梦幻哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "44c051e02252636596da06bcb8e80dcf9e06621522ea6cc23639b54eb47c6040", "ja": "どうしたんですかー？\nまつりちゃんが寝ちゃった話？", "zh": "怎么了呀——？\n是说小茉莉睡着的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1009_002chi", "source_sha256": "abc225edd3a19b41189cdf546bbe35f6af90a991dcd84697378e74e425a0568f", "ja": "きっと春香の夢の話ね。\nたしか今度、番組で作文を読む予定だって。", "zh": "我想一定是关于春香的梦吧。\n我记得她下次要在节目上读自己写的作文。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "9efd375a4e4942ead0faf588be896a2a0f953d0fb495cfab135513f8b5f7df6e", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れさま！\n{$P$}さんも一緒だったんですね？", "zh": "两位都辛苦啦！原来{$P$}先生也和你们一起啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1011_p", "source_sha256": "17a2ac16a0d7cd29de799e7b4974e98a3b5e4ffda8e655692c2d6e617f566779", "ja": "ああ、これで全員かな。\nさて、春香の話だけど……。", "zh": "啊，这样就全员到齐了吧。\n那么，关于春香的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "fd0036af80766b9be347453535e4dfc622e39172e997b54e30b8da57c2f9f51b", "ja": "春香さんの……夢のお話？", "zh": "春香的……梦想的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "9ff0587cec1e01908da11cf89c98fbea095b91608082ca3a49402557e3c62059", "ja": "未来ちゃん、知っていたのです？\n小さいころの春香ちゃんの夢は、なんと……！", "zh": "未来，你知道吗？\n小时候的春香的梦想，竟然是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "b17744b40d803ac783654c98d559f37f6cf98473c67ad8a204554d7236acdf92", "ja": "アイドルになること、だったそうですよ♪", "zh": "听说是成为偶像哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "282fdce56efd6eb4deabfcc4300b3160800a43ee2a1c85327bc7f72c0eb5519f", "ja": "えっ。……わあっ、すごーい！　じゃあ春香さん、\nもう夢をかなえちゃったんですね！", "zh": "诶。……哇，好厉害！那么春香姐，你已经实现梦想了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "9830328c9b0b6e8827c87d0ee526aeb8268e41a95ac437040aef741dc41747a2", "ja": "あれ？", "zh": "那个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "ca3d96c3410a5e8533f100ad345d4f90c0cc63cf32138c8ba71bb9a0f1f3db10", "ja": "あら？", "zh": "哎呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "b25577c75a6c930405155d1d64e778770784750704da1541977000c567c034b9", "ja": "ほ？", "zh": "哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "18a2d6dbb4595b1061835872fb0180ccff73a79078676c38097c8a2ae01b2026", "ja": "もしかして、そうなるのです？", "zh": "难道真的会变成那样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "a59614af7c8b12cdfeac0335ca3f39150f322c7ad1c46d66a2c3a060c4cd8c1b", "ja": "もしかしなくても、そうかもしれませんね？", "zh": "就算不用猜，也可能确实是这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "c87a2708c614669ffac72e796af54d9be3f1c957fb8b2ae299049070b180e8cb", "ja": "うーん。アイドルには、確かになれたけど……。\nでも、まだまだかなぁ？", "zh": "嗯……确实是成为偶像了，但是……感觉还差得远呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "64d3db7f6742e8e30deb5c332ef44be90921fca8b4c56f2bd19736243da4043b", "ja": "まだ、やらなくちゃいけないことばっかりだし。\nそれにやりたいことも、増えるばっかりだしね♪", "zh": "还有好多必须去做的事呢。\n而且，想做的事情也越来越多了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "a6c738b65fc9b7affbb8f76459bf99391e0dec051d5729fff250cf737c6dc158", "ja": "え～。春香さん、もうすっごく忙しいのに。それでも\nダメなんですか、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "诶～。春香小姐明明已经忙得不得了了。即使这样也不行吗，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1024_p", "source_sha256": "d16c31e9fc9732aa8c60addedcae955c450dd6fd171884f128f2cc8d2d186815", "ja": "どうかな。でも、本人がそう言うなら、\n間違いなく、まだなんだと思うよ。", "zh": "不好说。不过，既然她本人都这么说了，那肯定就是还没到时候吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "78e7a2a22d3dd13e181e348c0032d91965532a881ada0d2697247970013eaf83", "ja": "そっかぁ。\n春香さんでも、まだなんだ……。", "zh": "这样啊。\n连春香前辈都还没……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1026_002chi", "source_sha256": "9907e642c58cd5e00f561242d6ff1b46ce59d585e8b5d2f449b88c79b85c5f48", "ja": "あ。{$P$}、時間は平気ですか？\n確か春香は、この後ツアーの……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，时间还来得及吗？\n我记得春香接下来要进行巡演的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1027_p", "source_sha256": "2e86060843da8547a07725b4e9f504e6737640cbf30795d0b3698be9f5bab8ef", "ja": "おっと、コンサートホールでリハだったな。\nじゃあ手短に。", "zh": "哦，对了，是在音乐厅彩排来着。那我长话短说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1028_p", "source_sha256": "face61c37bb9121507c2dba5b68a7ea4fb1bff8c69a0542444dbb27e57dbabe3", "ja": "春香、お待たせ。今のミニコンサートツアーの\nファイナルだけど、やっと会場が決まったよ。", "zh": "春香，让你久等了。关于现在这个迷你演唱会巡演的最终场，场地终于定下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1029_001har", "source_sha256": "bc32c3df2a1fdbd52fb528c2b0d176d9839debdfc36262153eb97a927fc71ab4", "ja": "あっ、そうなんですね、よかったです♪\nそれで……、どこですか？", "zh": "啊，原来是这样，太好了♪\n那么……在哪里呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_1030", "source_sha256": "023df32719ece12db5034e9e67ec0b72e34a2ff9a143aaaf142c81cada64c3f8", "ja": "ここです", "zh": "就是这里", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_2000_p", "source_sha256": "b7952e0daf42f4ccc5aa87b0126aa2201e85460c3b2925fb655a197e69835432", "ja": "ここだ。次の劇場公演でセンターを頼めるか？\n公演メンバーは、ここにいる全員で！", "zh": "就是这里。下次的剧场公演，能请你担任Center吗？\n演出成员就由在场的所有人组成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_2001_001har", "source_sha256": "25be76b8c9ffce3b15b046a3ea1187c8b40e119d556a5e9a218760d6fa1ba5b6", "ja": "わぁ……！", "zh": "哇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_2002_p", "source_sha256": "b1b6f757a9b220594d413b53ef5ec30dbfe7bbf5bfc2903582f18d56a9e06196", "ja": "劇場での春香のセンター公演を、ツアーファイナル\n公演にしようと思う！　……で、いいかな？", "zh": "我想把春香在剧场的Center公演，作为巡演最终场公演！……这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_068_2003_001har", "source_sha256": "a71cb53576393c797a46c506a1ca434abf00775b6e2c0b333132b33332e93425", "ja": "はいっ、もちろんです！　ありがとうございます♪\nみんな、よろしくね！　私も、全力で頑張ります！", "zh": "好的，当然可以！谢谢您♪\n大家，请多多关照！我也会全力以赴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
